       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIVIDEREMAINDERDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TOTAL-SECS  PIC 9(6) VALUE 98765.
       01 HOURS       PIC 9(3).
       01 MINS        PIC 9(2).
       01 SECS        PIC 9(2).
       01 LEFTOVER    PIC 9(4).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DIVIDE TOTAL-SECS BY 3600 GIVING HOURS REMAINDER LEFTOVER
           DIVIDE LEFTOVER BY 60 GIVING MINS REMAINDER SECS
           DISPLAY TOTAL-SECS " SECONDS = "
                   HOURS "H " MINS "M " SECS "S"
           STOP RUN.
